  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1101.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this chapter is to ensure that facilities are located, designed, operated, and closed in a manner that does not endanger public health or adversely affect the environment and which minimizes the potential for accidents that could lead to personal injury or property damage.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1100); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2801.01); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14108, eff 11-13-24, EXPIRES: 11-13-34",
